(549290, 86, 'mp_20_1_text', '<font size="5" color="#990000"><b>これからの地震対策は、「今までの地震対策」に「制振」をプラス</b></font><div><p style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2.25; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: " fot-筑紫ゴシック="" pr5="" m",="" "ヒラギノ角ゴシック="" pro",="" "hiragino="" kaku="" gothic="" メイリオ,="" meiryo,="" sans-serif;="" font-size:="" 16px;="" font-style:="" normal;="" font-variant-ligatures:="" font-variant-caps:="" font-weight:="" 400;="" letter-spacing:="" orphans:="" 2;="" text-align:="" start;="" text-indent:="" 0px;="" text-transform:="" none;="" white-space:="" widows:="" word-spacing:="" -webkit-text-stroke-width:="" text-decoration-style:="" initial;="" text-decoration-color:="" initial;"="" align="center"><font size="5"><b>あなたの建物とそこに住まう家族を守ります。</b></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2.25; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: " fot-筑紫ゴシック="" pr5="" m",="" "ヒラギノ角ゴシック="" pro",="" "hiragino="" kaku="" gothic="" メイリオ,="" meiryo,="" sans-serif;="" font-size:="" 16px;="" font-style:="" normal;="" font-variant-ligatures:="" font-variant-caps:="" font-weight:="" 400;="" letter-spacing:="" orphans:="" 2;="" text-align:="" start;="" text-indent:="" 0px;="" text-transform:="" none;="" white-space:="" widows:="" word-spacing:="" -webkit-text-stroke-width:="" text-decoration-style:="" initial;="" text-decoration-color:="" initial;"="" align="center"><font size="3"><b><br></b></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 2.25; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: " fot-筑紫ゴシック="" pr5="" m",="" "ヒラギノ角ゴシック="" pro",="" "hiragino="" kaku="" gothic="" メイリオ,="" meiryo,="" sans-serif;="" font-size:="" 16px;="" font-style:="" normal;="" font-variant-ligatures:="" font-variant-caps:="" font-weight:="" 400;="" letter-spacing:="" orphans:="" 2;="" text-align:="" start;="" text-indent:="" 0px;="" text-transform:="" none;="" white-space:="" widows:="" word-spacing:="" -webkit-text-stroke-width:="" text-de