(533469, 10393, 'mp_2_1_text', '<div><font size="5"><span style="background-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);"><b>現在の規格サイズにない玄関ドアの交換</b></span></font></div><div><font size="2"><br></font></div><div><font size="4"><font size="2">名古屋市緑区にて、玄関ドアの交換をさせていただきました。</font></font></div><div><font size="4"><font size="2">高さが260cmと大きな玄関ドアです。</font></font></div><div><font size="4"><font size="2">高さ260ｃｍは各メーカーの規格サイズではありません。<br></font></font></div><div><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" size="2">ランマ付き仕様にして、規格サイズの玄関ドアを収めました。<br></font></div><div><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" size="2"><br></font></div><div><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;" size="2">ランマ付って和風により過ぎない？という方、ご参考にされてください。<br></font><div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" size="2">ランマからの採光もあって、お客様には喜んで頂きました。</font></div><div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Meiryo; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" size="2" color="#660000"><br></font></div><div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Meiryo; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" size="2" color="#660000">新しい玄関ドア</font></div><div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" size="2">・リクシル　リシェント</font></div><div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" size="2">・工法　玄関カバー工法</font></div><div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Meiryo; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><font style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;" size="2">・工期　1日<br style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; letter-spacing: normal;"></font></div><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></div><div><br></div>'),
